def about():
    body=f'''<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">About Scott Nguyen</p><h1>An experienced operator.<br>Your day-to-day partner.</h1><p class="lead">I'm the founder of Simple Consulting, based in Toronto. I help brands, manufacturers and distributors manage marketplace accounts and the inventory, fulfilment and reporting behind them.</p>{btns()}</div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><img class="founder-image" src="/assets/scott-nguyen.webp" width="340" height="425" alt="Scott Nguyen, founder of Simple Consulting"><div><h2>A practical perspective, built over 15+ years.</h2><p>My background spans retail, e-commerce and operations, including nine years in progressive roles at Staples Canada. My experience across Amazon, Walmart and other channels has developed through that broader career.</p><p>I work on the details that connect channel performance: listings, advertising, stock availability, purchase orders, fulfilment, returns and reporting. A useful recommendation needs an owner and a way to put it into practice.</p><p>You work with me directly. We agree on responsibilities, access, approvals and the reporting cadence before work begins.</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/scott-nguyen-0b97723a0">View my professional background on LinkedIn →</a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><h2>Where I can help</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Marketplaces and retail</h3><p>Amazon Vendor Central, Seller Central and FBA; Walmart Marketplace and WFS; and experience with Best Buy, Costco, Wayfair, Home Depot and other retail channels.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Operations and process</h3><p>Inventory planning, fulfilment coordination, returns, vendor requirements and practical process improvement informed by Lean Six Sigma training.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Systems and reporting</h3><p>ERP, Power BI, business-system integration, Google Ads and analytics work that connects the available information to operating decisions.</p></div></div><p class="small muted" style="margin-top:24px"></p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Working together</p><h2>Clear priorities. Direct communication. Agreed responsibilities.</h2><p class="lead">A project can address one defined issue. Ongoing management can cover recurring channel tasks. Fractional support can coordinate priorities across your wider business.</p><p>Start by telling me what is happening and what you want to improve. We will discuss the right scope and the information needed to assess it.</p></div><a href="/services.html">Explore the services →</a></div></section>{cta()}'''
    base('about.html','Scott Nguyen | E-commerce & Marketplace Consultant Canada','Meet Scott Nguyen, founder of Simple Consulting in Toronto. More than 15 years across retail, e-commerce and operations. Direct, practical channel support.',body)
